  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On the fourth inner city battle stage in Shang Clan City, spectators shout that the matchup subdues strength path while Fang Yuan trades blows with him. He is almost three meters tall, body heavy with fat that makes head and limbs look smaller, a height produced by Gu rather than ordinary human measure. Bai Ning Bing hears that the fat disperses strikes and, with a Gu, returns them as counter-shock. He sits on the stage, lets Fang Yuan attack, and claims he can send eighty percent of force back. Spectators also praise him as worthy of rank eight in fourth inner city.",
      "chapters": [
        299
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is huge, almost three meters tall. His whole body is full of fats, making his head and limbs look smaller. That height comes from Gu rather than ordinary human measure, which normally does not cross two meters.",
      "chapters": [
        299
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In his killing move rolling blade meat, his whole body curls into an enormous meatball wrapped in pale black blade aura, then he can cancel that form and turn back to human form.",
      "chapters": [
        300
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan goads him, Zhu Ba curls into a meatball wrapped in pale black blade aura. Spectators shout the killing move as rolling blade meat. Bai Ning Bing reads movement-type rolling meat Gu with blade aura Gu, amplified by his size. Fang Yuan circles the meatball and hits varied spots until counter-shock fails. Zhu Ba cancels the meatball form himself and turns back to human form. Under later punches his defense crumples; eighty percent of force explodes through his body as backlash and his heart suddenly stops from the intense pain. Fang Yuan then presses with a punch chain as bear, boar, crocodile, and horse phantoms flash in turn.",
      "chapters": [
        300
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rolling-blade-meat-and-defeat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_rolling_meat_gu",
        "gu_blade_aura_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking at the number eight expert of fourth inner city beaten until he vomits blood, the crowd’s expectations break. Zhu Ba bear-hugs Fang Yuan; Fang Yuan breaks free with all-out effort Gu’s green bull phantom. Zhu Ba admits defeat, and the host announces Fang Zheng wins, Zhu Ba loses. Bai Ning Bing reads his style as first using defense to waste an opponent’s primeval essence and stamina, then counterattacking, and judges that endless essence and strength-path stamina beat that plan here.",
      "chapters": [
        301
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rolling-blade-meat-and-defeat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_all_out_effort_gu",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    }
  ],
